      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GROVE DALE (1) worked to find the lead but couldn't keep going and finished ninth last time out over 2190m at this track, that effort coming after a nice second at this track the run prior. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Tackles a similar assignment and he can bounce back straight away. KEAYANG CRIPPA (5) has had two runs this campaign and is yet to finish in the top three. Was again unable to find the frame last start when he finished fifth over 2240m at Swan Hill, beaten 17 metres. Ideally placed and is sure to play a major role. HESASTAR (10) didn't do a bad job when sixth over 2240m at Swan Hill last time out. Each-way claims. CORNELIA (8) disappointed last time when tenth over 2190m at this track. Can do a lot better so worth considering.",
